The immediate-after constraints lock Hana–Gus–Dev into three consecutive slots and Finn–Ben into two. Exactly one person between Dev and Elif, with Hana before Ann before Elif, puts Elif two slots after Dev. Exactly one person between Ben and Elif then places Finn–Ben immediately after Elif. The only start that still fits slots 1–9 and leaves a legal seat for Cara is Hana in slot 2, which forces Ann between Dev and Elif, Cara two after Finn, and Ivo in the remaining slot before Finn.

